# The README's first recording: browse, search deeper, filter, preview.
Output docs/demos/overview.gif
Require fff
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 90ms

Hide
Type "source docs/demos/env.sh && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "fff" Sleep 400ms Enter Sleep 1.5s
Type "j" Sleep 500ms Type "j" Sleep 500ms Type "j" Sleep 800ms
Type "i" Sleep 300ms Type "res" Sleep 800ms
Escape Sleep 300ms Escape Sleep 500ms
Type "l" Sleep 1.2s
Type "+" Sleep 800ms Type "+" Sleep 1.2s
Type "i" Sleep 300ms Type@200ms "stab" Sleep 1.5s
Escape Sleep 300ms Escape Sleep 300ms
Type "j" Sleep 1s
Type "gP" Sleep 800ms
Type "j" Sleep 900ms Type "j" Sleep 900ms Type "j" Sleep 900ms
Escape Sleep 800ms
Type "q" Sleep 800ms
